    "detailed_description": "A princess has gone missing but who should answer the call? Why, Xavienne- the snarky oni from another world- of course! Who did you expect? She'll gather two of her &quot;buddies&quot; and journey to hell and back to save her best friend. A short RPG with a simple twist and tactical combat with a plot driven by unique characters.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A brisk story rife with charm.<br></li><li>Three playable characters each with starkly different personalities and abilities.<br></li><li>Tactical party-based, turn-based combat that requires figuring out how to dismantle your enemies' forces, yet simple enough for all gamers!<br></li><li>Two character-based story decisions, leading to two different endings.</li></ul>",
